  voiceDelay: 2.5
  newsScript: 'Good evening. We interrupt our program with breaking news. Over the
    past few hours, coffins have been appearing throughout the city: in alleyways,
    in parks, and in the middle of our streets. No one has claimed responsibility.
    Tonight, police received an anonymous warning about what the sender calls a vampire.
    Authorities are urging residents to stay indoors and to report anything unusual.
    We will bring you more on this story as it develops.'
